India district boundaries
=========================

These polygons are a simplified, quantised, delta-encoded derivative of the
Bharatlas LGD Districts (2024) layer.

Source page: https://bharatlas.com/view/lgd_districts
Download: https://bharatlas.com/api/dl/admin/districts/LGD_Districts.geojson
Upstream codes: https://lgdirectory.gov.in/
Dataset: LGD snapshot 2024 (card updated 2026-05-19)
Fetched: 2026-10-23
Source SHA-256: 95829298abdd0e80fc514b8c70787bdeef9aaf0e63b348177493045e8b22bab5

The source page states both CC0-1.0 and CC-BY-4.0. This copy complies with
CC BY 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

© Bharatlas. Source: Local Government Directory.

Credit Bharatlas, link the licence, and indicate that changes were made.
Changes: Visvalingam simplification at 500 metres (mapshaper
0.6.113, topology kept, intersection repair off), coordinates
quantised to 4 decimal degrees, rings stored as DSB1 version 2 (int32
anchor, int16 deltas) in india_districts.dsb (lgd-2024-dsb1-500m).
